\pard\sb200\sa180\b\fs31 User Stories: Food Delivery Application\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 Source: \\USER_STORY_EXAMPLE.docx\\ from Sergei Budnik's STORAGE collection (v1.0.0, September 2025). The original file contains four user stories in a table, reproduced below in their original business framing as a new educational public edition.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 No.    |    Actor    |    User story\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-01    |    Customer    |    As a user, I want to browse the menu of a specific restaurant so that I can select dishes I like\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-02    |    Customer    |    As a user, I want to add and remove dishes from my order so that I can assemble the desired order\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-03    |    Customer    |    As a user, I want to pay for the order by card so that I can complete ordering and payment\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-04    |    Courier    |    As a courier, I want to accept an order so that I can begin delivery\b0\f0\par
\pard\sb190\sa100\b\fs25 Example acceptance criteria (added for instructional use)\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-02 \u8212? Basket editing\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given a customer has opened a restaurant menu, when they add an available dish to the basket, then the basket contains that dish and its selected quantity.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given the basket has a dish, when the customer removes it, then that dish is absent and the order total is recalculated.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-03 \u8212? Card payment\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given a valid pending order, when the customer authorizes payment and the provider confirms success, then the order payment state becomes confirmed.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given the payment provider times out after receiving the request, then the platform keeps the outcome pending/unknown instead of reporting a decline without evidence.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 US-04 \u8212? Courier acceptance\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given a courier is offered a currently available order, when they accept it, then only one courier is assigned by the authoritative dispatch service.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 - Given another courier already accepted the order, then the second acceptance is rejected or offered an updated assignment state.\b0\f0\par
\pard\sa85\fs19 The original contained only the story table. The acceptance criteria, states and business ownership rules are new teaching additions. They are not claims about a deployed delivery platform.\b0\f0\par
